    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE: This game does not have matchmaking. You must buy at least two copies to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a<i> Triangular Geometric Hazard</i>. There are other<i> Triangular Geometric Hazards</i>. You must <strong>defeat</strong> them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820330/extras/46c5054d4736b0175e1e0b8fc432a0ef.avif?t=1752072332\" width=768 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>hazard versus</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced multiplayer arena shooter. Play with your friends! Play with your enemies! Play with anyone!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay, such that anyone can learn to play instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex movement options, using the Hammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon! Will you use the Shotgun, the Revolver, or something else?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOTE: This game does not have matchmaking. You must buy at least two copies to play.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a<i> Triangular Geometric Hazard</i>. There are other<i> Triangular Geometric Hazards</i>. You must <strong>defeat</strong> them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820330/extras/46c5054d4736b0175e1e0b8fc432a0ef.avif?t=1752072332\" width=768 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>hazard versus</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a fast-paced multiplayer arena shooter. Play with your friends! Play with your enemies! Play with anyone!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple gameplay, such that anyone can learn to play instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex movement options, using the Hammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your weapon! Will you use the Shotgun, the Revolver, or something else?</p></li></ul>",
